<title>JAPAN: Nippon Credit to forgive loans to mortgage firm.</title>
<headline>Nippon Credit to forgive loans to mortgage firm.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd said on Monday that it had decided to forgive loans of 160.91 billion yen which it had extended to a housing loan company.  </p>
<p>The loans are those extended to Nippon Housing Loan Co Ltd, Nippon Credit said in a statement.</p>
<p>Nippon Credit said the move would not affect its earnings in the year to March 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
